<title>PHILIPPINES: Metro stockholders approve dividend.</title>
<headline>Metro stockholders approve dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockholders of Metro Pacific Corp approved at a special meeting on Friday a proposal to declare a 33 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The record date for the dividend is yet to be approved by the Philippine Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>&quot;The stock dividend is designed to broaden Metro Pacific's equity base,&quot; the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>Metro Pacific shares were unchanged in early Manila trade.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8936, Fax 817-6267</p>
